      "source": "<a href=\"TimeToLive.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>TimeToLive</code></a> marks a single numeric property on aggregate root to be used for setting expirations in Redis. The\nannotated property supersedes any other timeout configuration.\n\n<pre><code>\n@RedisHash\nclass Person {\n  @Id String id;\n  String name;\n  @TimeToLive Long timeout;\n}\n</code>\n</pre>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"TimeToLive.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core 中的注解接口\"><code>TimeToLive</code></a> 标记聚合根上的单个数值属性，用于在 Redis 中设置过期时间。该标注的属性将覆盖任何其他超时配置。\n\n<pre><code>\n@RedisHash\nclass Person {\n  @Id String id;\n  String name;\n  @TimeToLive Long timeout;\n}\n</code>\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
